---
import Command from './Command.astro';

interface Props { routingPrompt: string }
const { routingPrompt } = Astro.props;
const setupPrompt = `Help me set up the Herdr app, Shepherdr 3.x and HolyCow for this project.
Follow https://herdr.dev and https://github.com/eliasstravik/shepherdr/blob/main/docs/install.md.
Check prerequisites, existing installations and my installed agent CLIs.
If I have an older setup, read docs/upgrading.md before changing it;
preserve its data and custom instructions. Inspect the install dry run.
Keep my model, access, review, merge and worktree settings. Honor this
repository's checkout policy; do not start tasks to test the installation.
Install HolyCow for the agents I use, then run shepherdr doctor.
Walk me through sign-in and selecting the Shepherdr layout in Herdr.`;
const firstTaskPrompt = `I want to add team invitations to this project.
Use HolyCow to help me decide who can invite people, which roles they can
grant, and when invitations expire. Recommend the next useful skill.
Wait for my decisions before planning or building.`;
const roles = [
  { agent: 'Assistant', model: 'Guide the work', effort: 'Your chosen agent', jobs: 'Guide · Plan · bounded handoffs', symbol: '↗' },
  { agent: 'Worker', model: 'Do the task', effort: 'Your chosen agent', jobs: 'Assigned skill · evidence · configured review', symbol: '↳' },
  { agent: 'Reviewer', model: 'Check the result', effort: 'Your chosen agent', jobs: 'Review code or plans · report findings', symbol: '✓' },
];
---
<div class="herdr-setup">
  <header class="herdr-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">Herdr + Shepherdr setup</p>
    <h1>Your agents.<br /><span>One place.</span></h1>
    <p class="herdr-lede">A workspace, an Assistant, and a useful next step.</p>
    <p class="herdr-note">Using our recommended setup? <a href="/docs/bossgoat/">Follow the BossGoat guide →</a> This page covers upstream Shepherdr.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="herdr-pieces" role="group" aria-label="How the three tools fit together">
    <div><span class="piece-symbol" aria-hidden="true">▥</span><p class="piece-label">The workspace</p><h2>Herdr</h2><p>Keep your agent terminals together.</p></div>
    <div><span class="piece-symbol" aria-hidden="true">☷</span><p class="piece-label">The tasks</p><h2>Shepherdr</h2><p>Talk to your Assistant. Follow the work.</p></div>
    <div><span class="piece-symbol" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><p class="piece-label">The method</p><h2>HolyCow</h2><p>Clarify, plan, build, and review.</p></div>
  </div>
  <p class="herdr-note">Best for several agents. One agent? HolyCow works on its own, too.</p>

  <section class="herdr-section" aria-labelledby="herdr-start-heading">
    <div class="herdr-heading"><h2 id="herdr-start-heading">Let your agent set it up.</h2><span>01 / Install</span></div>
    <Command command={setupPrompt} label="Paste in your agent chat" />
    <details class="herdr-details"><summary>Prefer terminal commands?</summary>
      <p>macOS or Linux · Python 3.8+ · Git · Node.js 22.20+. Install and sign in to Claude Code or Codex first. Shepherdr’s installer adds Bun if needed.</p>
      <Command command={'curl -fsSL https://releases.herdr.dev/app/install.sh | sh\nherdr-app --version\nhc --version'} label="Install Herdr app 0.1.12+ · core 0.1.17+" />
      <p>Open the Herdr app once. Keep the Shepherdr checkout for future updates.</p>
      <Command command={'git clone https://github.com/eliasstravik/shepherdr\ncd shepherdr\n./install.sh --dry-run'} label="Preview the Shepherdr installation" />
      <p>Review the proposed changes before applying them. For an older installation, read the migration section in the full reference first.</p>
      <Command command={'./install.sh\nshepherdr doctor'} label="Install Shepherdr · check the setup" />
      <p>Select the Shepherdr layout with <kbd>Ctrl+Shift+L</kbd> and create a space for your project folder.</p>
      <Command command={"npx skills@latest add NeuralHerd/holycow -g -a claude-code codex --skill '*'"} label="Install HolyCow" />
      <p>Keep only the agents you use after <code>-a</code>; add <code>cursor</code> for standalone Cursor use. Open fresh agent sessions to load the skills.</p>
    </details>
  </section>

  <section class="herdr-section" aria-labelledby="herdr-roles-heading">
    <div class="herdr-heading"><h2 id="herdr-roles-heading">Give each agent a job.</h2><span>02 / Configure</span></div>
    <p class="section-intro">Choose agents in Shepherdr settings → Agents. Keep the models and effort levels you already use.</p>
    <div class="herdr-roles">
      {roles.map(role => <div class="herdr-role"><div class="role-top"><p>{role.agent}</p><span aria-hidden="true">{role.symbol}</span></div><h3>{role.model} <span>{role.effort}</span></h3><p class="role-jobs">{role.jobs}</p></div>)}
    </div>
    <p class="herdr-note">A skill doesn’t change the model in an existing chat. Settings can apply Everywhere or to one space.</p>
    <details class="herdr-details"><summary>Copy the HolyCow role setup prompt</summary>
      <p>Paste into a coding-agent chat to merge guidance into the installed role instructions. Preserve existing settings and task commands.</p>
      <Command command={'herdr-task config --json'} label="Inspect settings from your project folder" />
      <Command command={routingPrompt} label="Paste in your coding-agent chat" />
    </details>
    <details class="herdr-details"><summary>Check guidance after changing defaults</summary>
      <p>Save a compact handoff and start a fresh agent session after editing role instructions. Verify its model and guidance. Closing the Herdr window does not restart agents.</p>
      <p>Check an existing task’s Settings block with <code>herdr-task show &lt;task-id&gt;</code>; changed defaults do not rewrite its running brief.</p>
    </details>
  </section>

  <section class="herdr-section" aria-labelledby="herdr-try-heading">
    <div class="herdr-heading"><h2 id="herdr-try-heading">Describe the work.</h2><span>03 / Try it</span></div>
    <p class="section-intro">Try this with your Assistant after setup. Swap in your own idea.</p>
    <Command command={firstTaskPrompt} label="Example · paste in your Assistant chat" />
    <div class="herdr-result"><span aria-hidden="true">↳</span><div><h3>A clear next step</h3><p>The Assistant recommends a skill and helps clarify decisions before work starts.</p></div></div>
    <p class="herdr-note">Tasks use worktrees by default. For the original checkout, verify Tasks → Worktrees and your repository’s policy before starting work.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="herdr-update" aria-labelledby="herdr-update-heading">
    <div><h2 id="herdr-update-heading">Keep it fresh.</h2><p>Update the tools. Reload the guidance.</p></div>
    <details class="herdr-details"><summary>Update commands</summary>
      <p>For an existing Shepherdr 3.x installation, run from its installation checkout. Older versions need the migration guide first.</p>
      <Command command={'git pull --ff-only\nshepherdr update\nshepherdr doctor'} label="Update Shepherdr 3.x" />
      <p>Update HolyCow with the same install command above. Ask ongoing agents to re-read changed guidance, or start a fresh session.</p>
    </details>
  </section>
</div>

<details class="herdr-reference">
  <summary>Full setup reference <span>Optional · settings, review, and migration</span></summary>
  <slot />
</details>

<style>
  .herdr-reference { display: block; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding-top: 22px; }
  .herdr-reference > summary { display: list-item; font-size: 13px; cursor: pointer; color: var(--ink); }
  .herdr-reference > summary span { display: block; margin: 6px 0 0 17px; color: var(--ink-70); font-size: 11px; }
  .herdr-intro .eyebrow { font-size: 10px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .herdr-intro h1 { font-size: clamp(42px, 5vw, 64px); letter-spacing: -.06em; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .herdr-intro h1 span { background: linear-gradient(transparent 77%, var(--gradient-sky) 77%); }
  .herdr-lede { font-size: 17px; color: var(--ink-70); margin-bottom: 30px; }
  .herdr-pieces { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 24px; }
  .herdr-pieces > div { position: relative; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 16px; padding: 20px 16px; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--gradient-peach) 27%, var(--card)); }
  .herdr-pieces > div:nth-child(2) { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--gradient-sky) 27%, var(--card)); }
  .herdr-pieces > div:nth-child(3) { background: var(--background-green); }
  .herdr-pieces > div:not(:last-child)::after { content: '+'; position: absolute; left: calc(100% + 7px); top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); color: var(--ink-50); font-size: 16px; }
  .piece-symbol { display: grid; place-items: center; width: 34px; height: 34px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px; background: var(--white-80); margin-bottom: 18px; font-size: 22px; color: var(--ink); }
  .herdr-pieces .piece-label { font: 9px/1.5 monospace; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .7px; margin-bottom: 7px; }
  .herdr-pieces h2 { font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: -.03em; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .herdr-pieces p { font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ink-70); margin: 0; }
  .herdr-note { font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ink-70); margin: 12px 0 0; }
  .herdr-section { margin-top: 38px; }
  .herdr-heading { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 15px; margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .herdr-heading h2, .herdr-update h2 { font-size: 23px; letter-spacing: -.035em; margin: 0; }
  .herdr-heading > span { flex-shrink: 0; font: 10px monospace; color: var(--ink-70); }
  .section-intro { font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-70); margin: -5px 0 18px; }
  .herdr-setup :global(.command) { border-radius: 13px; background: var(--card); }
  .herdr-setup :global(.command-bar) { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--gradient-sky) 16%, var(--card)); font-size: 11px; padding: 10px 16px; }
  .herdr-setup :global(.command pre) { white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: anywhere; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.8; padding: 18px; }
  .herdr-details { margin-top: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; background: var(--card); }
  .herdr-details summary { font-size: 12px; cursor: pointer; color: var(--ink); }
  .herdr-details > p { font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ink-70); margin: 16px 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .herdr-details :global(.command) + :global(.command) { margin-top: 14px; }
  .herdr-roles { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 12px; }
  .herdr-role { padding: 18px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 14px; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--gradient-peach) 20%, var(--card)); }
  .herdr-role:nth-child(2) { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--gradient-sky) 20%, var(--card)); }
  .herdr-role:nth-child(3) { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--gradient-coral) 15%, var(--card)); }
  .herdr-role:nth-child(4) { background: var(--background-green); }
  .role-top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .role-top p { font-size: 11px; margin: 0; color: var(--ink-70); }
  .role-top > span { font-size: 21px; color: var(--ink); }
  .herdr-role h3 { display: flex; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: -.035em; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .herdr-role h3 span { padding: 3px 7px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 5px; background: var(--white-60); font: 9px/1.5 monospace; letter-spacing: 0; color: var(--ink-70); }
  .role-jobs { font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ink-70); margin: 0; }
  .herdr-result { display: flex; gap: 14px; padding: 18px 20px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 13px; background: var(--background-green); margin-top: 12px; }
  .herdr-result > span { font-size: 25px; color: var(--badge-success); }
  .herdr-result h3 { font-size: 17px; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .herdr-result p { font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink-70); margin: 0; line-height: 1.7; }
  .herdr-update { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1.4fr); align-items: start; gap: 18px; margin: 34px 0; padding-top: 28px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .herdr-update > div p { font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink-70); margin: 8px 0 0; }
  .herdr-update .herdr-details { margin-top: 0; }
  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .herdr-intro h1 { font-size: clamp(35px, 9vw, 48px); }
    .herdr-lede { font-size: 15px; }
    .herdr-pieces { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 20px; }
    .herdr-pieces > div { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 38px minmax(0, 1fr); column-gap: 14px; padding: 16px; }
    .piece-symbol { grid-row: 1 / 4; margin: 0; }
    .herdr-pieces > div:not(:last-child)::after { left: 50%; top: auto; bottom: -22px; transform: translateX(-50%); }
    .herdr-pieces h2 { margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .herdr-pieces .piece-label { margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .herdr-pieces p { grid-column: 2; }
    .herdr-heading { align-items: flex-start; }
    .herdr-heading h2 { font-size: 21px; }
    .herdr-heading > span { font-size: 9px; padding-top: 6px; }
    .herdr-role { padding: 14px; }
    .herdr-role h3 { font-size: 20px; }
    .herdr-update { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 380px) { .herdr-roles { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
